{"uid":"6fc7c57a13d9728f","name":"test_run_detail_labels_a_stale_task_read_and_never_blinks_empty","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub#test_run_detail_labels_a_stale_task_read_and_never_blinks_empty","historyId":"e2825898202d987000ec4cde29795efb","time":{"start":1791867340931,"stop":1791867389979,"duration":49048},"description":"Task 005 (#15): the browser half of the hardened task read.\n\n    `tasks.json` is written by *pi*, non-atomically, while the hub polls every\n    4 s -- so the pre-#15 run-detail view rendered `(no tasks)` for a whole\n    cycle whenever a poll landed inside a rewrite, and (worse) said nothing\n    about it. Tasks 002-004 made the reader serve the last plan that parsed,\n    flagged `tasksStale`/`tasksSource`; this asserts the browser both KEEPS\n    showing that plan and LABELS it, so an operator is never shown stale rows\n    as if they were current, and never shown an empty plan that isn't one.\n\n    Drives the real failure mode: an agent-style truncate+rewrite loop across\n    several poll cycles, then a file left truncated so a poll is guaranteed to\n    land on it, then a healthy rewrite which must clear the label again.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 005 (#15): the browser half of the hardened task read.</p>\n<pre><code>`tasks.json` is written by *pi*, non-atomically, while the hub polls every\n4 s -- so the pre-#15 run-detail view rendered `(no tasks)` for a whole\ncycle whenever a poll landed inside a rewrite, and (worse) said nothing\nabout it. Tasks 002-004 made the reader serve the last plan that parsed,\nflagged `tasksStale`/`tasksSource`; this asserts the browser both KEEPS\nshowing that plan and LABELS it, so an operator is never shown stale rows\nas if they were current, and never shown an empty plan that isn't one.\n\nDrives the real failure mode: an agent-style truncate+rewrite loop across\nseveral poll cycles, then a file left truncated so a poll is guaranteed to\nland on it, then a healthy rewrite which must clear the label again.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791866936748,"stop":1791866936748,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791866936749,"stop":1791866936749,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791867340924,"stop":1791867340925,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791867340924,"stop":1791867340924,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791867340926,"stop":1791867340927,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791867340926,"stop":1791867340926,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791867340927,"stop":1791867340927,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"